('early-warning-signs-and-shock-emergencies::knowledge_1','early-warning-signs-and-shock-emergencies','early-warning-signs-and-shock-emergencies:knowledge',1,'Explain the rationale for EARLY WARNING SIGNS i.e. to provide an integrated approach to the recognition and response to ''at risk'' patients, preventing avoidable deterioration.',1001,false),
