('medication-administration::skills_5','medication-administration','medication-administration:skills',5,'10 Rights of giving Medication Administration is observed: 1) Right patient 2) Right medication 3) Right dose 4) Right time 5) Right route 6) Right to refuse 7) Right Patient Education 8) Right Assessment 9) Right Evaluation 10) Right Documentation.',2005,false),
